% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: fonts shared across pages. Helvetica with the same encoding on
% two pages is one font object in the document, referenced from both
% pages' resources; a second size is the same resource.
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
72 700 moveto (First) show
showpage
/Helvetica findfont 24 scalefont setfont
72 700 moveto (Second) show
showpage
